<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance falls in November.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance falls in November.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank fell to 1.246 billion dinars at the end of November from 1.284 billion the previous month, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- fell to 2.573 billion dinars at the end of November from 2.591 billion at the end of October.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.815 billion in November 1995.</p>
<p>				 Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				November '96	  November '95</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     240.0		   512.5</p>
<p>  New Issue		   201.9		   508.9</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,245.8		 2,005.3</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured			60.0		    59.9</p>
<p>  New Issue		    80.0		    60.0</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,327.0		   809.2</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Kuwait newsroom +965 240 8945</p>
